WEBVTT

00:00:12.373 --> 00:00:14.453
Don't worry, we haven't forgotten you.

00:00:14.993 --> 00:00:18.053
Through your eyes, we saw worlds we never dreamed we'd reach.

00:00:18.553 --> 00:00:20.853
And you left a mark that time will never erase.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.613
Maybe your time in space is over,

00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:25.393
but we're here to bring your story back into the light.
